        {
          "term": "移除报错模组日志",
          "context": "是否在启动失败时移除报错模组的详细日志（仅显示摘要）。",
          "source": "docs/server-cores/30-magma.md"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key_path": "magma.use-multi-thread-entity-tick",
      "chinese_entries": [
        {
          "term": "多线程实体 tick",
          "context": "实验性：是否使用多线程处理实体 tick。⚠️ 与绝大多数 Forge 模组冲突，**强烈不建议开启**。",
          "source": "docs/server-cores/30-magma.md"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key_path": "magma.max-entity-ticks-per-tick",
      "chinese_entries": [
        {
          "term": "单 tick 实体上限",
          "context": "单次 tick 最多处理的实体数量。-1 不限制。模组较多的服务器可设上限防止实体爆炸卡服。",
          "source": "docs/server-cores/30-magma.md"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key_path": "magma.entity-tick-limit",
      "chinese_entries": [
        {
          "term": "实体 tick 限制",
          "context": "类似 max-entity-ticks-per-tick，限制实体 tick 总数。",
          "source": "docs/server-cores/30-magma.md"
        }
      ]
